      "mark": "[proxy] the square-peg proxy's reward_w_depth, paid per metre of NEW gated max depth (D-165). The proxy solved 1 mm clearance with it at 100; nothing on this task has sized it. Zero switches the term off and reproduces the pre-D-165 reward."
